Given the stylesheet below and `<section id="hero"><h2 class="title">Pricing</h2></section>`, which color renders?

```css
@layer base, components, utilities;

@layer utilities { .title { color: red; } }
@layer components { #hero .title { color: green; } }

.title { color: purple; }
```

